node_modules

# Vestigial since the database moved into the linewatch-data Docker volume — now
# holds only the MOVED-TO-DOCKER-VOLUME marker (docs/storage.md). Nothing here is
# the record: src/db/client.ts refuses a host-side open of this directory by
# path, so the guard survives a fresh clone that has no marker.
data
# Throwaway database for a native `bun run dev` / `bun run start`. Never the
# record — that only ever lives in the linewatch-data volume.
.dev-data
# `make db-backup` snapshots, and the pre-volume archive left by `make db-import`.
backups
collector/spool.jsonl
# The watchdog's two spools. Separate from each other because they drain over
# different networks — events against localhost, notifications across the WAN
# that is down when there is something to say — and both are runtime state.
collector/watchdog-events.jsonl
collector/watchdog-notify.jsonl
web/dist
*.log

# Carries the real bearer token (rendered by `make up`) — never commit it.
.env
